// Copy to ios/App/Local.xcconfig (gitignored). Sets the DEBUG gateway URL.
// xcconfig GOTCHA: `//` starts a comment ANYWHERE on a line, so a literal
// `wss://...` truncates to `wss:`. Put `$()` BETWEEN the two slashes (`/$()/`)
// so no literal `//` appears in source; `$()` expands to empty at build time →
// resolved value is wss://host/api/v1/ws.
// No port, i.e. 443 — inbound-proxy owns the LAN-facing 443 and the gateway
// itself binds loopback. This value takes precedence over GatewayConfig's Swift
// default, so it has to agree with it; 8888 still reaches the host from a
// simulator, which is exactly why a stale port here goes unnoticed.
GATEWAY_WS_URL = wss:/$()/localhost/api/v1/ws
